### ============================================================================
### SOLANA PROXY ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================================
### Acceso directo a métodos de Solana RPC

@api = https://servicioshilda.orioncaribe.com/api/v1

### ============================================================================
### 1. POST /solana/rpc - Solana RPC Proxy
### ============================================================================
### Proxy directo a Solana RPC methods
### Ver: https://docs.solana.com/api/http

POST {{@api}}/solana/rpc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "getBalance",
  "params": ["4Nd1m1Q5WJGj5CqPKYrZL2g4X2Y8Z3A4B5C6D7E8"]
}

### Response should be 200 OK with RPC response


